    finding "AG1" state="open" size="frame-sized" \
        text="the first run of this rule reported NOTHING, and the rule was correct. Corpus \
            violations were attributed to a file by searching its ROOT nodes for the entity id — and \
            a symptom lives inside its frame, a decision inside its iteration. The refusal was \
