        text="fixing AG1 by matching the id at any depth over-attributed instead: `attacks \"S1\"` \
            has S1 as its first argument, so every slice attacking S1 claimed the violation. It now \
            matches on KIND and id together" \
        note="the third attribution bug in this engine — S7 matched kind OR id, this matched id at \
